1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:02,750
(Howard:)Uh, so, this Glenn guy.

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:05,520
(Howard:)You say you went out with
him for, like, a year.

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,560
(Bernadette:)Do we really need to talk
about my old boyfriend now?

4
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,890
(Howard:)No. I guess not.

5
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:14,400
(Howard:)What is he, like,
six-four, six-five?

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,170
(Bernadette:)Six-seven.

7
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:20,370
(Howard:)Probably has a hard time
finding a suit that fits.

8
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:22,870
(Bernadette:)Is something
bothering you?

9
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:25,210
(Howard:)No. It's just...
What?

10
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,510
(Howard:)I'm just thinking.

11
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:28,040
(Howard:)If you had sex with that guy,

12
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:29,980
(Howard:)I mean, there's nothing
I can do here

13
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:35,120
(Howard:)that will make
any kind of... impact.

14
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:36,790
(Bernadette:)Howard, it's not a contest.

15
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:38,650
(Bernadette:)I love you.
I want to be with you.

16
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:41,290
(Howard:)Yeah, great, love you, too,
but...

17
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:44,690
(Howard:)If it were a contest,

18
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,200
(Howard:)I wouldn't have a chance, right?

19
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,430
(Bernadette:)You can't think
that way.

20
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:49,630
(Howard:)Yep.

21
00:00:49,630 --> 00:00:51,830
(Howard:)Loser.

22
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,500
(Bernadette:)Howard, stop it.

23
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:57,240
(Howard:)Sorry. I just
never figured that

24
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:59,480
(Howard:)a guy like me going out
with a girl like you

